{"id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-modal-formula.md","title":"Modal Formula","display":"df-modal-formula — Modal Formula","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-modal-formula","aliases":["89-df-modal-formula"],"display":"df-modal-formula — Modal Formula","depends_on":["[[89-df-function]]"],"revised":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-modal-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-modal-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-modal-formula — Modal Formula"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0d71e87a2f416230\" href=\"?note=0d71e87a2f416230\" title=\"89-df-function\">89-df-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prop}=\\{p_i\\mid i\\in\\omega\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Prop}=\\{p_i\\mid i\\in\\omega\\}\\)</span> 为可数无限命题字母集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_i=p_j\\Longleftrightarrow i=j\">\\(p_i=p_j\\Longleftrightarrow i=j\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot,\\neg,\\land,\\Box\">\\(\\bot,\\neg,\\land,\\Box\\)</span> 是自由生成的有限树构造子：各构造子为单射，像彼此及与字母集不交。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span> 遍历下述公式集。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow,\\top\">\\(\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow,\\top\\)</span> 是定义性缩写，不是额外原始构造子。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nF_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Prop}\\cup\\{\\bot\\},\\\\\nF_{n+1}&amp;\\coloneqq F_n\\cup\\{\\neg A,\\Box A\\mid A\\in F_n\\}\n\\cup\\{A\\land B\\mid A,B\\in F_n\\}\\quad(n\\in\\mathbb N),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}F_n,\\qquad\n\\top\\coloneqq\\neg\\bot\\\\\nA\\lor B&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg(\\neg A\\land\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\to B\\coloneqq\\neg(A\\land\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B\\coloneqq(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nF_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Prop}\\cup\\{\\bot\\},\\\\\nF_{n+1}&amp;\\coloneqq F_n\\cup\\{\\neg A,\\Box A\\mid A\\in F_n\\}\n\\cup\\{A\\land B\\mid A,B\\in F_n\\}\\quad(n\\in\\mathbb N),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}F_n,\\qquad\n\\top\\coloneqq\\neg\\bot\\\\\nA\\lor B&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg(\\neg A\\land\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\to B\\coloneqq\\neg(A\\land\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B\\coloneqq(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 1 章，印刷页 1–3；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n有限阶段构造给出一个集合；每个公式具有唯一有限语法树，允许按树高进行结构递归。原书取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot,\\to,\\Box\">\\(\\bot,\\to,\\Box\\)</span> 为原始符号；本目录保留已有的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot,\\neg,\\land,\\Box\">\\(\\bot,\\neg,\\land,\\Box\\)</span> 约定，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B=\\neg(A\\land\\neg B)\">\\(A\\to B=\\neg(A\\land\\neg B)\\)</span>，两种语言可有效互译，不改变定理或语义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"0d71e87a2f416230","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-function]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prop}=\\{p_i\\mid i\\in\\omega\\}","display":false},{"tex":"p_i=p_j\\Longleftrightarrow i=j","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot,\\neg,\\land,\\Box","display":false},{"tex":"A,B","display":false},{"tex":"\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow,\\top","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nF_0&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Prop}\\cup\\{\\bot\\},\\\\\nF_{n+1}&\\coloneqq F_n\\cup\\{\\neg A,\\Box A\\mid A\\in F_n\\}\n\\cup\\{A\\land B\\mid A,B\\in F_n\\}\\quad(n\\in\\mathbb N),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}&\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}F_n,\\qquad\n\\top\\coloneqq\\neg\\bot\\\\\nA\\lor B&\\coloneqq\\neg(\\neg A\\land\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\to B\\coloneqq\\neg(A\\land\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B\\coloneqq(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\bot,\\to,\\Box","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot,\\neg,\\land,\\Box","display":false},{"tex":"A\\to B=\\neg(A\\land\\neg B)","display":false}],"bytes":1592,"backlinks":[{"id":"883bfda9f28cc5ea","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"55612987d4585fa4","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a6d483dd2c6fd176","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c78885ae02bfb25f","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d246470e97fec132","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ is the freely generated modal-formula set from\n[[89-df-modal-formula]]."},{"id":"c6e69f0f07e062bc","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0e77586c4dc7e03a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"95a48b6ae42f7e48","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"3fc95f0f8defc51d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{